**Symptom:** A new application workload in Azure (10.200.10.0/24) cannot reach an on-premises database (172.16.5.10/32) over the IPsec tunnel. The tunnel is up. The application team reports UDP-based database queries are timing out, while ICMP and TCP-based health checks to the same database succeed.

